{
  "note": "Checkpoint two: family, divisions, mark and the printed label are fixed together here, before the figure shape is drawn. The label is the card's schematic line: '<Family> at <unit> <mark> of <divisions>'. The basis is a verbatim substring of that card's own record, naming the phrase that fixes the position; it never comes from another card.",
  "families": {
    "ledger": "ordered parts or columns; the marked part is the one at that position in the order the artifact lists them",
    "matrix": "cells of a two-axis grid; the marked cell is the one at that position, read row by row from the top-left",
    "axes": "a set of axes or a multi-position continuum; the marked axis is the one at that position in the artifact's order",
    "score": "several dimensions scored; the marked dimension is the one at that position in the artifact's order",
    "arc": "ordered stages; the marked stage is the one at that position in the artifact's order",
    "tiers": "stacked levels; the marked level is the one at that position in the artifact's order",
    "manifest": "a schema's layers or keys; the marked key is the one at that position in the artifact's order",
    "facets": "a set of facets; the marked facet is the one at that position in the artifact's order",
    "rings": "concentric rings numbered from the outer edge inward; the marked ring is the one at that position",
    "statement": "a constrained syntax; the marked clause is the one at that position in the statement",
    "network": "nodes with links; the marked node is the one at that position in the artifact's order"
  },
  "numbering": "Every family numbers what its artifact lists, in the artifact's own order. The single exception is rings, which are numbered geometrically from the outer edge inward, because one concentric shape cannot be numbered two ways: BRA-08's artifact lists its centre fifth and BRA-22's lists its centre first, and both centres are the ring the card marks.",
  "units": {
    "ledger": "part",
    "matrix": "cell",
    "axes": "axis",
    "score": "dimension",
    "arc": "stage",
    "tiers": "level",
    "manifest": "key",
    "facets": "facet",
    "rings": "ring",
    "statement": "clause",
    "network": "node"
  },
  "sizeRule": "Diagnostic size is set from the question's measured length: 115 characters or fewer at 9 pt, 136 or fewer at 8.5, 166 or fewer at 8, longer at 7.5. Every card's front is measured at its assigned size before the deck ships.",
